From: blockdomains OHOS port
Subject: [PATCH] HarmonyOS: provide __compar_fn_t for musl

musl does not define the glibc-internal __compar_fn_t comparator typedef
that database.c casts table_order to when calling qsort(3):
  error: use of undeclared identifier '__compar_fn_t'

Fix: typedef it locally when building against a non-glibc libc. Guarded by
__GLIBC__ so glibc builds are untouched.
---
--- a/src/database.c
+++ b/src/database.c
@@ -5,6 +5,10 @@
 #include <sys/stat.h>
 #include <sys/types.h>
 #include <unistd.h>
+/* musl (HarmonyOS) does not provide the glibc __compar_fn_t typedef. */
+#if !defined(__GLIBC__)
+typedef int (*__compar_fn_t)(const void *, const void *);
+#endif
 
